From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 06:56:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/vaddr: implement sz_filter_passed for
 migrate_{hot,cold} action

Support of DAMOS ops filter and sz_filter_passed support is up to each
operation set.  DAMON_VADDR supports both for only damos_stat action.
It intentionally does not support those for madvise-based actions
because applying filters could make the code unnecessarily complicated.
The vaddr implementation of migrate_{hot,cold} action does support DAMOS
ops filters but sz_filter_passed.  There is no real reason to not
support sz_filter_passed.  Add the support.

Pass the sz_filter_passed pointer to the filter applying logic and
accumulate the number.

Closes: https://sashiko.dev/#/bug/linux-986e8b64-8e65-4e32-970f-4d3ebdf8206e
Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/vaddr.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/mm/damon/vaddr.c b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
index cdefbb155cae2..505e55dc46d15 100644
--- a/mm/damon/vaddr.c
+++ b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
@@ -776,6 +776,7 @@ static bool damos_va_filter_out(struct damos *scheme, struct folio *folio,
 struct damos_va_migrate_private {
 	struct list_head *migration_lists;
 	struct damos *scheme;
+	unsigned long *sz_filter_passed;
 };
 
 /*
@@ -843,6 +844,7 @@ static int damos_va_migrate_pmd_entry(pmd_t *pmd, unsigned long addr,
 	struct damos_va_migrate_private *priv = walk->private;
 	struct list_head *migration_lists = priv->migration_lists;
 	struct damos *s = priv->scheme;
+	unsigned long *sz_filter_passed = priv->sz_filter_passed;
 	struct folio *folio;
 	spinlock_t *ptl;
 	pte_t *start_pte, *pte, ptent;
@@ -860,6 +862,7 @@ static int damos_va_migrate_pmd_entry(pmd_t *pmd, unsigned long addr,
 			goto huge_out;
 		if (damos_va_filter_out(s, folio, walk->vma, addr, NULL, pmd))
 			goto huge_out;
+		*sz_filter_passed += folio_size(folio);
 		damos_va_migrate_dests_add(folio, walk->vma, addr, s,
 				migration_lists);
 huge_out:
@@ -887,6 +890,7 @@ static int damos_va_migrate_pmd_entry(pmd_t *pmd, unsigned long addr,
 		nr = folio_nr_pages(folio) - page_idx;
 		if (damos_va_filter_out(s, folio, walk->vma, addr, pte, NULL))
 			continue;
+		*sz_filter_passed += folio_size(folio);
 		damos_va_migrate_dests_add(folio, walk->vma, addr, s,
 				migration_lists);
 	}
-- 
